UID: WORK-SDOC-EMBEDDED-LANGUAGE-FIELDS
TITLE: Fields may embed another language, named by a companion field
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
Let an sdoc field's content be written in another language, with a companion
field on the same node naming which language it is, so the tree-sitter
grammar knows what to parse the embedded content as.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Operator, 2026-09-02, verbatim: "allow fields to contain other languages
embedded, maybe with another field for the language."
<<<
